## Scope caveats (do not mistake a clean run for a full corpus)

- **Corpus size**: this reflects the entries actually run. Pricing the real defaults needs the top-N npm graphs installed and run — a network + install step outside the sandbox.
- **Lockdown arm not run**: the separate under-lockdown pass needs the freeze walk (Phase-2 minimal lockdown). Until then only the audit arm is measured, and the lockdown-default kill criterion stays unpriced.

